(7029587, 1066806, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Not the Grumpy Cat but a sad &amp; droopy cat. Aw, look at those sad eyes and frowny mouth. It makes me wonder what this cat is sad about such that it is giving us "the puppy dog eyes'' treatment of begging to get something back.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Not the Grumpy Cat but a sad & droopy cat. Aw, look at those sad eyes and frowny mouth. It makes me wonder what this cat is sad about such that it is giving us "the puppy dog eyes'' treatment of begging to get something back.', '2013-04-30 10:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029591, 1067000, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Ha! Vadering and in the hands of a kid is just dangerous:-) Love the addition of the detail of the boy wearing a Star Wars t-shirt. Expressions are great and add to the composition. I do have one critique and that is if the title is going to explain what is going on then you''d best have all the elements in the composition. There is nothing IN the photo itself to show the lack of cookies - we have to rely on the title more. I think if you had shown an empty cookie jar resting on the counter it would strengthen the scene in the photo.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Ha! Vadering and in the hands of a kid is just dangerous:-) Love the addition of the detail of the boy wearing a Star Wars t-shirt. Expressions are great and add to the composition. I do have one critique and that is if the title is going to explain what is going on then you''d best have all the elements in the composition. There is nothing IN the photo itself to show the lack of cookies - we have to rely on the title more. I think if you had shown an empty cookie jar resting on the counter it would strengthen the scene in the photo.', '2013-04-30 10:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029593, 1066827, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Beautiful shot of a fisherman in the late afternoon soon to be setting daylight hours. Great silhouette of the fisherman and pole against the sky. We can clearly see his hand extended with the fish in a gesture of offering. The stork/crane approaches in flight towards the offer to share. Lovely composition...not sure if it is a widely recognized meme, but well put together and captured.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Beautiful shot of a fisherman in the late afternoon soon to be setting daylight hours. Great silhouette of the fisherman and pole against the sky. We can clearly see his hand extended with the fish in a gesture of offering. The stork/crane approaches in flight towards the offer to share. Lovely composition...not sure if it is a widely recognized meme, but well put together and captured.', '2013-04-30 10:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(7029597, 1066691, 93565, '<td valign="top">Great example of a meme and well done!<br/>The posture on the dog is what really brings this home.</td>', 'Great example of a meme and well done!The posture on the dog is what really brings this home.', '2013-04-30 10:54:58.000000', NULL, 1),
