(7030116, 1066983, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Ha! That pug has an Oscar the Grouch type expression. Great photographic capture. Great details down to the whiskers on him. Wow, he/she has really big eyes - all the better to flash the ''puppy dog eyes'' at you to get what this doggie wants. Nicely done.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Ha! That pug has an Oscar the Grouch type expression. Great photographic capture. Great details down to the whiskers on him. Wow, he/she has really big eyes - all the better to flash the ''puppy dog eyes'' at you to get what this doggie wants. Nicely done.', '2013-04-30 23:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030119, 1067003, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>I hear those radio ads for that beer about 3 or more times a day. Seen some comercials too. Love the play on this ad campaign. Lighting, focus and details are great. The tear from the eye and the arched eyebrow are a nice touch for it captures the over the top ''acting'':-) Just one thing that seems odd and it is most likely the processing. The nose and parts of the forehead near the hairline seem overly ''cooked''/sunburned. Don''t know if that was intentional or not but I think that could be toned down to get better skin tones overall.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. I hear those radio ads for that beer about 3 or more times a day. Seen some comercials too. Love the play on this ad campaign. Lighting, focus and details are great. The tear from the eye and the arched eyebrow are a nice touch for it captures the over the top ''acting'':-) Just one thing that seems odd and it is most likely the processing. The nose and parts of the forehead near the hairline seem overly ''cooked''/sunburned. Don''t know if that was intentional or not but I think that could be toned down to get better skin tones overall.', '2013-04-30 23:58:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030120, 1066856, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Nice word play on this photo composition! Great focus on the little mouse. I think the glasses suit him - he looks cute and distinguished at the same time:-)</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Nice word play on this photo composition! Great focus on the little mouse. I think the glasses suit him - he looks cute and distinguished at the same time:-)', '2013-05-01 00:00:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030127, 1066876, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Ha! If thoughts popped up in a speech balloon all the truths people hide then we''d all be honest all the time or someone would invent a device/drug to quash that ability:-) The cat in the business suit gets the point across very well - one can say one thing swearing it''s the truth with a raised hand but the thoughts revel the truth. Two critiques: I think most speech bubbles are white so the black looks a bit odd. I understand why you did it because it pops off the backdrop more and the plate is white so that would get washed out. The backdrop is rather odd with so many transition fades in tone that it becomes a bit distracting. I think a solid tone would have made for a cleaner presentation - especially if your main subject can visually pop off the background more because of dynamic contrast.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Ha! If thoughts popped up in a speech balloon all the truths people hide then we''d all be honest all the time or someone would invent a device/drug to quash that ability:-) The cat in the business suit gets the point across very well - one can say one thing swearing it''s the truth with a raised hand but the thoughts revel the truth. Two critiques: I think most speech bubbles are white so the black looks a bit odd. I understand why you did it because it pops off the backdrop more and the plate is white so that would get washed out. The backdrop is rather odd with so many transition fades in tone that it becomes a bit distracting. I think a solid tone would have made for a cleaner presentation - especially if your main subject can visually pop off the background more because of dynamic contrast.', '2013-05-01 00:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030128, 1066159, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Now that is a unique way to demonstrate the word definition. Image is clear, sharp and lighting is fabulous. Love how the bold hues of purple and yellow also jump out and pop out at you.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Now that is a unique way to demonstrate the word definition. Image is clear, sharp and lighting is fabulous. Love how the bold hues of purple and yellow also jump out and pop out at you.', '2013-05-01 00:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7030130, 1066883, 43463, '<td valign="top">Voted earlier coming back to comment.<br/> <br/>Well that is a different form of Vadering:-) This shot has humor, it has expression, and an emotion that some can related too, but it is waaaaayyyy ''overcooked'' with the processing. One other critique (and this is a small one but nonetheless could increase the visual appeal) is that "Show don''t tell". We know he is a cheater from the title but there is nothing within the photo to show us without relying on the title. Perhaps having another girl laying on the ground with a fearful look on her face would have given a visual cue to the ''cheating boyfriend'' or maybe a wider picture to include all of the Vadering girlfriend to show an Iphone in the other hand and on the screen it shows a picture of this same guy kissing another girl.</td>', 'Voted earlier coming back to comment. Well that is a different form of Vadering:-) This shot has humor, it has expression, and an emotion that some can related too, but it is waaaaayyyy ''overcooked'' with the processing. One other critique (and this is a small one but nonetheless could increase the visual appeal) is that "Show don''t tell". We know he is a cheater from the title but there is nothing within the photo to show us without relying on the title. Perhaps having another girl laying on the ground with a fearful look on her face would have given a visual cue to the ''cheating boyfriend'' or maybe a wider picture to include all of the Vadering girlfriend to show an Iphone in the other hand and on the screen it shows a picture of this same guy kissing another girl.', '2013-05-01 00:37:21.000000', NULL, 1),
