(7030835, 1067000, 65234, '<td valign="top">Ah, family life LOL!  Very cute idea, and in my experience a lot of Internet memes are much like this in being somewhat snapshotty in appearance.  Easier to believe things are real that way, and not the product of some Photoshop wizard''s manipulation.  That said, I''d still prefer the background a bit blurrier from a photographic perspective, but that won''t affect my vote.</td>', 'Ah, family life LOL!  Very cute idea, and in my experience a lot of Internet memes are much like this in being somewhat snapshotty in appearance.  Easier to believe things are real that way, and not the product of some Photoshop wizard''s manipulation.  That said, I''d still prefer the background a bit blurrier from a photographic perspective, but that won''t affect my vote.', '2013-05-02 09:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
