(7030848, 1067005, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice image, though I don''t know what I think about the Sue in the window.  It does make for a nice diagonal to the composition, but my initial thought was that this would be one of those memes where Sue showed up in all sorts of different background places, not multiple times in the same scene.  Or maybe multiple needed to be more than two to make that idea work for me.  But it''s still a well-done image.</td>', 'Nice image, though I don''t know what I think about the Sue in the window.  It does make for a nice diagonal to the composition, but my initial thought was that this would be one of those memes where Sue showed up in all sorts of different background places, not multiple times in the same scene.  Or maybe multiple needed to be more than two to make that idea work for me.  But it''s still a well-done image.', '2013-05-02 10:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
