(7030973, 1066829, 100831, '<td valign="top">I have to assume the text is legal... funny! - and this message wouldn''t have worked as well with a square image (as are most memes) so I''m glad it''s not. I like it. 7</td>', 'I have to assume the text is legal... funny! - and this message wouldn''t have worked as well with a square image (as are most memes) so I''m glad it''s not. I like it. 7', '2013-05-02 13:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
