(7031023, 1066537, 83313, '<td valign="top">Love what you found here, but I think the photo could have been done in a better way. One thing that immediately comes to mind is this was taken from a standing height, and is dead centered. Not a lot of interest in the way it was shot, I''m afraid. Great find, however, and the perfect title for it!</td>', 'Love what you found here, but I think the photo could have been done in a better way. One thing that immediately comes to mind is this was taken from a standing height, and is dead centered. Not a lot of interest in the way it was shot, I''m afraid. Great find, however, and the perfect title for it!', '2013-05-02 15:08:13.000000', NULL, 1),
