(7031275, 1066884, 136989, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What else can I say?  A masterpiece. The location is incredible.  The cake (lie or not) looks delicious.  That is one intense look on her face and I LOVE that dress.  Only itsy bitsy critique from me is the bright highlight on her chest.  It''s a distraction but a minor one.</td>', 'Wow!  What else can I say?  A masterpiece. The location is incredible.  The cake (lie or not) looks delicious.  That is one intense look on her face and I LOVE that dress.  Only itsy bitsy critique from me is the bright highlight on her chest.  It''s a distraction but a minor one.', '2013-05-03 00:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7031277, 1066856, 136989, '<td valign="top">Absolutely adorable! Great play on words too. My fav in this challenge.</td>', 'Absolutely adorable! Great play on words too. My fav in this challenge.', '2013-05-03 00:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
