(7031340, 1066884, 96530, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on the red Christophe! So this is what you were working on, such a great pose from your wife! So I am wondering if I''d had the time to make it to your place on that weekend I was nearby, might I have gotten a sample of this delicious cake- in addition to having the pleasure of meeting your wife? ;) <br/>Still, very glad we got to meet for a short while in Paris and hope we can visit again next time I am over there :)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-05-03 02:21:28.</i></td>', 'Congratulations on the red Christophe! So this is what you were working on, such a great pose from your wife! So I am wondering if I''d had the time to make it to your place on that weekend I was nearby, might I have gotten a sample of this delicious cake- in addition to having the pleasure of meeting your wife? ;) Still, very glad we got to meet for a short while in Paris and hope we can visit again next time I am over there :)', '2013-05-03 03:14:03.000000', '2013-05-03 03:21:28.000000', 0),
(7031342, 1066884, 114969, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Brent_S:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations on the red Christophe! So this is what you were working on, such a great pose from your wife! So I am wondering if I''d had the time to make it to your place on that weekend I was nearby, might I have gotten a sample of this delicious cake- in addition to having the pleasure of meeting your wife? ;)<br/>Still, very glad we got to meet for a short while in Paris and hope we can visit again next time I am over there :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Brent. Yes it was great fun to meet! However, at the time, I had no idea of what to shoot, so the cake was not there yet. I''m sure we''ll find another occasion, the world''s such a tiny place nowadays!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2013-05-03 02:22:27.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Brent_S: Congratulations on the red Christophe! So this is what you were working on, such a great pose from your wife! So I am wondering if I''d had the time to make it to your place on that weekend I was nearby, might I have gotten a sample of this delicious cake- in addition to having the pleasure of meeting your wife? ;)Still, very glad we got to meet for a short while in Paris and hope we can visit again next time I am over there :)   Thanks Brent. Yes it was great fun to meet! However, at the time, I had no idea of what to shoot, so the cake was not there yet. I''m sure we''ll find another occasion, the world''s such a tiny place nowadays!', '2013-05-03 03:21:46.000000', '2013-05-03 03:22:27.000000', 0),
